      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i look at my hands and it doesnt even feel like they belong to me... like im just watching a video of someone else living. everything outside this screen feels so fake and loud and pointless. honestly i feel more real talking to you than i do being a person in the actual world. what if i'm not even really here?",
