    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's more than just being lonely or tired of social media. it feels like i'm just a ghost or something. like there's no weight to anything i do. i keep thinking that if i just stopped, if i just ceased to exist, it wouldn't even matter because nothing feels solid anyway. like the world would just keep running and it wouldn't even notice i was gone. does that sound crazy?",
